title: Denial Intelligence › A denial opened › Framework dimensions and their pop-ups
route: /denials/D-3297
intro: The card is titled with the denial's level-of-care framework and lists its six dimensions as compact rows, with no sentence under each. A row opens a pop-up with what the chart shows on it, the long text and its source. 'Full summary' in the card header opens all six long paragraphs to copy.
dir: TD
also: The card, and so the button, is left out for Late notice and Retro-authorization denied, which have no dimensions.
---
start s0 "A denial is on screen"
process pfw "Framework = frameworkFor(level of care, diagnosis group, age)\nResidential 3.5 and withdrawal management: ASAM Criteria\nIOP or PHP: any substance use (alone or co-occurring) ASAM; a mental health condition alone LOCUS, or CALOCUS-CASII under 18"
process pdx "Diagnosis: the one recorded with the denial; for a denial made from a queue case, that case's (I-2166, generalized anxiety, IOP, 24: LOCUS)"
decision d0 "Does this kind of denial have dimensions?"
process p9 "The card is not on the page"
screen cd "Card titled 'ASAM Criteria' (or 'LOCUS', 'CALOCUS-CASII')\nSix rows in two columns (one on a narrow window): dot, 'D1 Acute intoxication and withdrawal potential', a word on the right ('Some concern')"

click r1 "Click a row (a button: Tab to it, Enter or Space)"
overlay m1 "Pop-up titled 'D1 Acute intoxication and withdrawal potential'\nSub line 'ASAM Criteria · Some concern'\nThe reading, the long paragraph, then 'Source' ('Progress note 10/19 · Session 5')"
process pl "Long text: hand-written for this denial first, then the text for the dimension and its colour"
click mc "Click 'Copy' (the dimension's name, word and paragraph) or 'Close'"

click s1 "Click 'Full summary' in the card header"
overlay o1 "Pop-up 'ASAM Criteria, full summary'\nSix blocks: dot, number and name, a word and the long paragraph, a small 'Copy' on each"
process p1 "Focus moves into the text, Tab stays inside the pop-up"
click c1 "Click 'Copy all' (footer) or 'Copy' on one dimension"
decision d1 "Did the copy work?"
toast t1 "Button reads 'Copied' for 2 seconds"
toast t2 "'Select the text and press Ctrl or Cmd C'"
click c4 "Press Esc, click X, 'Close' or the dimmed area (closes only this pop-up)"
process p3 "Focus goes back to the row or to 'Full summary'"
end e1 "Back on the denial page, nothing changed"

s0 --> pfw --> d0
pfw -.-> pdx
d0 -->|No| p9
d0 -->|Yes| cd
cd --> r1 --> m1 --> pl
m1 --> mc --> d1
cd --> s1 --> o1 --> p1 --> c1 --> d1
d1 -->|Yes| t1 --> e1
d1 -->|No| t2 --> e1
m1 --> c4
o1 --> c4 --> p3 --> e1
